# Steady state hypothesis (SSH) of frame s2-f1, normal operation: the p and q of its loads, and nothing
# else. The feeder has no switch: its breaker is in the substation frame and its tie in the
# distribution-area frame (dso_area.cimtbl).
# Load it after the frame's structural model.

Profile = cim18v17

Update Table EnergyConsumer: mRID, p (kW), q (kvar)
    ld_s2_f1_mid,  800, 200
    ld_s2_f1_step, 500, 120
